Package: refPanelTools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Reference Panel Datasets
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 2026-09-04
Authors@R: person("Donghyung", "Lee", email = "leed13@miamioh.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for indexing, extracting, and simulating data from
    BGZF-compressed whole-genome sequencing reference panel datasets such as
    the 33KG panel. Functions support extraction by chromosome, population
    subset, or genomic region, as well as simulation of association Z-scores
    under the null for multi-ethnic GWAS.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/statsleelab/refPanelTools
BugReports: https://github.com/statsleelab/refPanelTools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: zlib
